Error [jet.AtomicInsideTransaction]: `Atomic` cannot be used inside `#Transact`
  --> tests/ui/atomic_inside_transact.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |         _: counter.add(1)
    |                    ^^^
 Why: `Shared<T>` is the lock-guarded family for multi-value transactions; `Atomic<T>` is one lock-free scalar and has no transaction commit semantics
 Fix: Move the atomic operation outside `#Transact`, or use `Shared<T>` when several values must commit together
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0752
